{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415343","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415343","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041534301:1":{"text":"もうすぐ冬祭りね。懐かしいわあ。","source_cn":"隆冬节快到了，真怀念呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F8EEA5BAC2E316","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041534302:1":{"text":"スノーツリーを見ると、ユグドラシルの流光の樹を思い出すわ。もちろん、あなたたちの夢の中で見たんだけど！","source_cn":"每次看到雪灯树，我就会想起薄暮丛林的流荧树——当然，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A29B6CB388EC5BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041534303:1":{"text":"スノーツリーは、私たちユグドラシルの人が流光の樹を真似て木に飾り付けをしたのが始まりですから。","source_cn":"毕竟雪灯树一开始就是薄暮丛林的人们纪念流荧树才搞出来的装饰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF33A85AF534DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041534304:1":{"text":"大陸のどこにいても、空を仰いだ先に見える白雪と――","source_cn":"无论在大陆任何一个地方，只要抬起头看到飘落的雪花……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7470973B6D6DBE12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041534305:1":{"text":"眩い光に照らされた青い枝葉が、寂しさを和らげてくれるのです。","source_cn":"看到璀璨的灯光下依旧青翠的树枝，离乡的人就不会感到孤独。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB2EE41122618DF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041534306:1":{"text":"そうね。あたしも故郷を離れた人たちの夢の中で、何度もその光景を目にしたわ。","source_cn":"是啊，我曾经在无数离乡的游子梦中看到过那熟悉的枝叶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19322D4A4ECD2F64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041534307:1":{"text":"でも、今寂しさを感じてるのは、家で家族を待っている方じゃない？","source_cn":"不过，我怎么感到，现在反而是在家等待的亲人比较孤独呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x425ABECA3F721131","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041534308:1":{"text":"そ、そんなことないですよ！まったく、クインったら、今頃どこで遊んでるんだか……","source_cn":"哼，洛桑那家伙，不知道又玩到哪去了，我才不会想他呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B8785EF1BE42C0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:塔西":{"text":"タシー","source":"塔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}